1
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:03,960
不准祈求 不准装可怜
No begging. No begging.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,320
斯黛拉 你让我心碎了
Stella, you're breaking my heart here.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:09,280
让你心碎的是香肠和培根
What's breaking your heart is that sausage and bacon.

4
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,500
你就不能只吃一种吗
Can't you just pick one?

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,840
别担心 我会在高尔夫球场上
Don't worry. I'm gonna burn it off

6
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:12,680
消耗掉热量的
on the golf course.

7
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:13,880
怎么消耗 杰
How, Jay?

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,300
坐在高尔夫球车上消耗
By riding the little cart

9
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,100
还是靠把球踢回场内
or by kicking the ball back into play?

10
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,620
拿着 我要带乔·弗汉希欧去公园
Here. I'm gonna take Joe Fulgencio to the park.

11
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,400
你能去超市买点东西吗
Can you please stop by the grocery store?

12
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,560
为什么不让保姆去
Why doesn't the nanny do this?

13
00:00:23,845 --> 00:00:25,520
你逗我呢吧
You got to be kidding me!

14
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,360
歌洛莉亚已经开除五个保姆了
Gloria has fired five nannies.

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,920
我不希望我家里有别的女人
I don't like another woman in my house.

16
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,280
我要当唯一的明星
I want to be the star.

17
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,260
明星都有保姆
Stars have nannies.

18
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,760
你知道这里面多少有曼尼的错
You know that some of this is Manny's fault.

19
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:38,900
曼尼
Manny!

20
00:00:40,926 --> 00:00:43,916
玛丽 你今天晚餐想做什么
So, Marie, what do you feel like doing for dinner tonight?

21
00:00:43,916 --> 00:00:45,406
你晚上就吃麦片吧
You're eating Dyno-Bites

22
00:00:45,406 --> 00:00:46,720
因为你还是个小屁孩
because you are a little boy.

23
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:47,200
老妈
Mom!

24
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,620
我告诉你 这孩子以后将会
I'm telling you, there's an embarrassing

25
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,360
面临一场难堪的记者招待会
press conference in that kid's future.

26
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,680
我们要在七个月后结婚
We're getting married in seven months.

27
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:54,540
或者八个月后
Or eight months.

28
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:56,620
我担心四月份总是阴雨绵绵
I worry about it raining in april.

29
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,188
我担心五月天热会出汗
Well, I worry about me sweating in may.

30
00:00:58,188 --> 00:01:00,282
我们什么都定不下来
Oh, well, we can't decide on anything.

31
00:01:00,282 --> 00:01:01,840
有 有太多选择了
There -- there are too many choices.

32
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,020
幸运的是 我们的一个好朋友
Fortunately, one of our best friends

33
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:03,800
是活动策划人
is an event planner.

34
00:01:04,573 --> 00:01:06,340
-胡娇 -胡娇
- Pepper! - Pepper!

35
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:08,720
*新郎驾到*
*Here come the grooms*

36
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:11,760
*身着我的胡娇系列无尾礼服*
*All dressed in fun tuxes from my Pepper collection*

37
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,760
哇塞 瞧瞧你这一堆创意
Ha, wow -- look at all your ideas.

38
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,180
亲爱的 这些只是目录
Honey, this is just the index.

39
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:15,940
罗纳多
Ronaldo!

40
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,000
我带来了多种桌布 餐具
I brought linens and place settings

41
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,920
请帖 还有高脚杯
and invitations and stemware.

42
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,360
你们好 我是罗纳多
Hello. I'm Ronaldo.

43
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:23,540
别跟个话闸子似的
Oh, don't be such a chatterbox.

44
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:25,181
去把装餐盘的闸子拿来
And go and fetch the platter box.

45
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:27,160
把这张沙发拖走吧
Now, let's lose this couch.

46
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:28,860
你需要那么大地方吗
Wow, you need that much space, huh?

47
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,720
不是 因为太丑了
No, it's hideous.

48
00:01:30,940 --> 00:01:33,080
这话你们肯定不是头一回听吧
This can't be news to you.

49
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,280
你毁了我的生活
You're ruining my life!

50
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,640
这鸡蛋很好吃啊
These eggs are delicious.

51
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:53,220
你有生活吗 从我的房间滚出去
What life?! Get out of my room!

52
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:54,240
我在里面加了牛奶
I put milk in them.

53
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:56,000
这已经不是你的房间了
It's not your room anymore!

54
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,180
口感非常松软
Well, they sure are fluffy.

55
00:01:57,180 --> 00:01:58,327
妈
Mom!

56
00:01:58,461 --> 00:02:01,023
-早上好老爸 -早上好 伙计们
- Hey, dad. - Morning, troops.

57
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:03,460
克莱尔 我欠你一盒女士剃刀
Claire, I owe you a pack of lady razors.

58
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,360
我要去院子里待一会儿
I'm just gonna go stand out in the yard.

59
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,440
真的 快滚出去
Seriously, get out!

60
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:08,040
我说过了 这不是你的房间
I told you it's not your room!

61
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:10,120
海莉跟艾丽克斯的关系
Tension between Haley and Alex

62
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,480
最近非常紧张
has been getting pretty high,

63
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:14,540
所以我们本来要让海莉搬到地下室
so our solution was to move Haley down to the basement,

64
00:02:14,540 --> 00:02:16,420
但当我们刚打算实施时
which we were just about to do --

65
00:02:16,420 --> 00:02:18,400
我爸爸来跟我们共度周末
When my dad came out for a weekend visit.

66
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:19,380
两周前就来了
Two weekends ago.

67
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,960
我妈妈去世后
After my mom passed away,

68
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,460
他开始跟名叫安妮的女人交往
he dated this woman named Annie,

69
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:23,880
后来她跟我爸分手
and she broke up with him,

70
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,020
我爸现在情绪有些低落
and then he seemed kind of down,

71
00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:26,160
所以我邀他过来
so I invited him out.

72
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:27,465
太恶心了 那是我的袜子
Gross! Those are my socks!

73
00:02:27,465 --> 00:02:28,910
才不是 妈
They are not! Mom!

74
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,240
我要出去待会儿
I'm just gonna pop outside.

75
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:32,800
我该给她买把耙子
I should get her a rake.

76
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,780
欢迎来到君临城
Welcome to King's landing!

77
00:02:37,860 --> 00:02:40,100
我是邪恶的小国王
I am the evil boy king,

78
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,600
现在我要取了你们的首级
and I want your heads!

79
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:45,280
瞧瞧他们多喜欢你啊
Oh, look how much they all love you.

80
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,483
谢谢
Ohh, thanks.

81
00:02:46,492 --> 00:02:47,544
我只是想跟孩子们的电子游戏
I'm just trying to match the energy

82
00:02:47,553 --> 00:02:49,880
还有猜猜我是谁之类的游戏较较劲
of their video games and whosits and whatnots.

83
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,520
我要去打网球了
So, I'm gonna play tennis.

84
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:52,460
中午来接你
I can pick you up at noon.

85
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,560
-你好 你是琼对吧 -对
- Oh, hi! Joan, right? - Yes.

86
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,180
你好 我叫安迪
Hi. I'm Andy.

87
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,960
我是她的"曼尼" 就是男保姆的意思
I'm her manny -- male nanny.

88
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:00,100
你好 我叫歌洛莉亚
Hi, I'm Gloria.

89
00:03:00,558 --> 00:03:02,380
我说这话可能有点神经质
This might just sound a little crazy,

90
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:04,580
但我觉得琼好像不喜欢我
but I don't think Joan likes me.

91
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,260
这不是神经质 她确实不喜欢你
Oh, that's not crazy. She doesn't.

92
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:08,100
她丈夫总是盯着你看
Her husband's always staring at you,

93
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,360
她担心你会抢了她老公
and she's worried you're gonna steal him.

94
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:12,140
-什么 -开心点 小家伙
- What?! - Be happy, little guy.

95
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,160
这个世界属于你
This world belongs to you.

96
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,560
我才不会抢别人的男人
I would never steal anybody else's man,

97
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,160
特别是她那个胖老公
especially not her fat husband.

98
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,840
他现在一点也不胖了
Hey, he's not fat anymore.

99
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:21,320
我帮他减了30磅
I helped him lose 30 pounds.

100
00:03:22,370 --> 00:03:24,260
谢谢你 安迪
Thank you, Andy.

101
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:24,860
小心
Careful.

102
00:03:24,980 --> 00:03:26,160
你要是受点小伤
If I bring you home scratched,

103
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,320
我的保证金就没了
I lose my deposit.

104
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:29,080
我略懂一些烹饪
I'm kind of a chef, too.

105
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,620
来 尝尝这个
Here, try this.

106
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:34,340
这是藜麥做的
It's quinoa.

107
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:36,900
消化它的过程就能消耗卡路里
You actually burn calories while eating I--

108
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:38,320
安迪 告诉我
So, Andy, tell me,

109
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,540
你在琼家干得开心吗
are you really happy with that Joan?

110
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:46,320
每场婚礼都别具一格 宛如每一片雪花
Every wedding is unique, like a snowflake.

111
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:48,780
而我的任务就是为你们
And my job is to give you

112
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:51,540
打造一片让每个人羡慕嫉妒恨的雪花
the snowflake that makes everyone die with jealousy.

113
00:03:51,721 --> 00:03:53,348
我们要的就是这个效果
That's all we ever wanted.

114
00:03:54,001 --> 00:03:56,140
那么我们先从配色开始吧
So, let's start with a color palette.

115
00:03:56,140 --> 00:03:57,320
容我为你呈上
I'm thinking...

116
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:58,920
浓情深紫
Purple.

117
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,567
-深紫 这颜色还真是 -哇
- Purple! That is a color! - Wow!

118
00:04:00,567 --> 00:04:02,620
我们不太 不太喜欢深紫
We don't love -- yeah, we don't love purple.

119
00:04:02,620 --> 00:04:04,320
不是我们的最爱 不过
Not our favorite, but...

120
00:04:05,658 --> 00:04:06,849
-什么 -深紫有点
- Excuse me? - Well, it's just that purple

121
00:04:06,849 --> 00:04:08,040
太过火了
might be a little bit bold for --

122
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,880
不 我懂 你当我是白痴对吧
No, I get it. You think I'm an idiot.

123
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:11,040
-没有 -不是那个意思 胡娇
- No. No! - No, we don't, Pepper.

124
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,980
你俩显然比我在行多了
Well, obviously, you know better than I.

125
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:14,120
毕竟 我只帮人策划过
After all, I've only put on

126
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,660
数百场梦幻婚礼而已
hundreds of magnificent weddings.

127
00:04:15,779 --> 00:04:16,955
走吧 罗纳多
Come, Ronaldo.

128
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:19,020
人家小两口不在乎婚礼策划
They're not interested in planning a wedding.

129
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:22,080
只喜欢糟蹋别人的心
They're interested in hurting people.

130
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,220
别走啊 胡娇 等一下
No, Pepper. Pepper, wait.

131
00:04:23,220 --> 00:04:23,900
别这样 胡娇 听我说
No, Pepper, wait. Listen. No, no.

132
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,200
我们可以考虑一下深紫色
We can consider purple.

133
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,760
我们只是一下子接受不了而已
This is just a lot for us to take in.

134
00:04:30,274 --> 00:04:31,947
那是自然 我明白了 我
Of course. I get it. I...

135
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:35,960
就让这个方案好好浸淫一下你们吧
Let the idea wash over you for a bit.

136
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:39,200
我们也可以考虑更素净的配色
We had also discussed a more neutral palette.

137
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:41,328
罗纳多 人家正浸淫着呢
Ronaldo! They're washing!

138
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:44,480
不好意思哦 他其实人不坏
I'm sorry. He means well.

139
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:49,660
现在 来谈谈你俩的出场方式
Now, let's talk about your entrance.

140
00:04:49,820 --> 00:04:51,000
太好了 出场方式
Yes. Entrance.

141
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:54,800
两个男人能够共结连理
The idea of two men being able to marry

142
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:57,040
堪称是一场童话传奇
seemed like a fantasy,

143
00:04:57,050 --> 00:05:00,730
所以我设想你俩是这样走上紫色长毯的
so I see you riding down the purple aisle

144
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:02,660
共同骑在一匹
on a...

145
00:05:04,900 --> 00:05:05,700
独角兽上
...unicorn.

146
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,240
爷爷 你确定吗 会挺好玩的哦
Are you sure, grandpa? It might be fun.

147
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,980
抱歉 卢克 我今天实在没这个心情
Sorry, Luke. I just don't think I have it in me today.

148
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,460
你瞧见了没
Did you see that?

149
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:21,920
你爸什么时候
When has your dad ever

150
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,300
拒绝过和卢克玩拉手指放屁的游戏
not wanted to pull Luke's finger?

151
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,120
他心里难过着呢 菲尔
He's hurting, Phil.

152
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:26,440
他应该去看看心理医生
I think he needs to see a therapist.

153
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:27,880
克莱尔 我爸才不需要心理医生呢
Claire, he doesn't need a therapist.

154
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,280
为什么 老公 医生就是干这个的
Why? Honey, that's what they do.

155
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:31,040
专门帮人治疗情伤
They help people cope with loss.

156
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,740
如果实在需要 他们甚至会上门服务
They'll even come to the house if we need them to.

157
00:05:33,620 --> 00:05:35,500
我应该请教一下我爸 知道吗
I should talk to my dad. You know what?

158
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:37,140
离婚之后他的心情也一度低沉
He was pretty down after the divorce.

159
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:38,700
-他肯定有办法 -是吗 因为你爸
- I bet he has some insight. - Yeah, 'cause your dad's

160
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:39,900
十分通情达理 善解人意吗
so in touch with people's feelings?

161
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,580
当人家被席琳·迪翁的演唱会
When a man is overcome with emotion

162
00:05:41,580 --> 00:05:42,840
深深打动时
at a Celine Dion concert,

163
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,640
-他不该要人家硬气一点 -菲尔
- you do not tell him to grow a pair! - Phil!

164
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,380
泰坦尼克虽沉 人间真爱永存
The ship went down, but their love lasts forever!

165
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,000
老爸 你好啊
Dad? Hi.

166
00:05:48,294 --> 00:05:50,680
我说 弗兰克最近心情不好
Yeah, listen. Uh, Frank is really depressed.

167
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,920
我觉得他应该找个心理医生
I think he should see a therapist.

168
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,900
-你觉得呢 -他才不需要那玩意呢
- What do you say? - He doesn't need any of that!

169
00:05:53,900 --> 00:05:56,584
对吧 我也是这么说的
Yeah? Uh-huh. T-that's exactly what I said.

170
00:05:56,584 --> 00:05:57,820
-电话给我 -我
- Give me that. - I-I...

171
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:58,820
杰 你刚才说什么
Jay, what did you just say?

172
00:05:58,980 --> 00:06:00,280
带他出去 认识几个妹子
Take him out and meet some women.

173
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:03,460
一千个医生也抵不上歌洛莉亚对我的治疗
1,000 therapists couldn't do what Gloria did for me.

174
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:05,240
我同意 克莱尔她说错了
Oh, I agree. Claire was wrong.

175
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:07,300
告诉你 我知道个不错的地方
I'll tell you what. I know a fun place.

176
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:10,080
今晚 你我和弗兰克一起出去找点乐子
Tonight, you, me, and Frank out on the town.

177
00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:11,240
太好了 我们三人行耶
Oh, fun! A three-way!

178
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,020
话一出口我已经后悔了
I already regret this.

179
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,700
我也很期待 不过我得先挂了
Well, I'm excited, too. I got to get going, though.

180
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,780
回见 拜
All right. Bye.

181
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:20,480
歌洛莉亚 我们回来了
Gloria, we're back!

182
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,600
来来来 让我帮你拿这个
Here! Let me lighten your load.

183
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,200
-你是谁呀 -我是新来的"曼尼"
- Who are you? - I'm the new manny.

184
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,600
你是来取代我的吗
Am I being replaced?

185
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:29,700
杰 曼尼 快来见见乔的新保姆安迪
Jay, Manny, meet Joe's new manny, Andy.

186
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:31,400
-我能借一步说话吗 -谢谢 不能
- Can I talk to you a second? -No, thank you.

187
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,880
我们应该好好商量一下这事
We're gonna need to discuss this.

188
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:35,080
我明白 这个决定事关重大
I get it. I understand it's a big decision.

189
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:37,160
如果能让你放心一点的话
But if it eases your mind at all,

190
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:39,040
我不光是来照顾宝宝乔的
know that I'm not just here for baby Joe.

191
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,660
我也是来照顾你们的
I'm here for you, too.

192
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,820
这话可一点没让我放心
Doesn't ease my mind at all.

193
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:44,400
我的任务就是让你们全家
My mission is to make all of your lives

194
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,520
过得更开心 活得更健康
happier and healthier.

195
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:49,040
难道是因为我吃掉了那条巨型三明治吗
Is this because I ate that party sub?

196
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,737
哎呀 该死
Ohh! Crackers!

197
00:06:50,860 --> 00:06:52,680
我把电话落在育婴房里了
I left my phone upstairs in the nursery.

198
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,600
你能去帮我拿一下吗
Could you grab it for me?

199
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,340
我能理解人们在听到"健康"二字时
I know people get all squirrelly

200
00:06:58,340 --> 00:06:59,540
做出的奇怪反应
when they hear the word "Healthy."

201
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:02,680
其实 曼尼 手机在我兜里呢
Actually, Manny? My phone is in my pocket.

202
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:03,600
不好意思 哥们
Sorry, bud.

203
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:05,710
我的目标是让你们在不经意间...
But my goal is to get you healthy without --

204
00:07:05,710 --> 00:07:06,540
不对
Nope!

205
00:07:06,540 --> 00:07:08,040
我兜里这个是一包口香糖
It is just a pack of gum.

206
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:09,880
手机还在楼上
My phone is still upstairs.

207
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:12,880
就变得健康起来
-- without you even realizing what's happening.

208
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:15,420
我真是后知后觉
Wow. I'm such a dodo.

209
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:16,880
我今天根本就没带手机
I didn't even bring my phone today.

210
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:17,940
我知道你在干什么
I know what you're doing.

211
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:19,258
这事我们得商量一下
We are gonna talk about it.

212
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:23,380
你有我的号码 我明天就可以开始工作
Okay, well, you have my number, so I can start tomorrow.

213
00:07:23,665 --> 00:07:25,180
-打给我 -我会的
- Call me. - I will!

214
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:25,560
保重
Take care!

215
00:07:26,020 --> 00:07:28,238
这个人不行 继续找吧
That's a nonstarter. Keep looking.

216
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,300
可是他很完美
But he's perfect.

217
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,780
他是男的 这很怪异
He's a man. It's weird.

218
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:33,380
他是个怪异的男人
He's a weird man.

219
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:35,660
就像菲尔 唯一区别是我还得付他钱
He's like Phil, only I have to pay for him.

220
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:38,140
家里不是某人独裁的 是民主的
This is not a dictatorship! It's a democracy!

221
00:07:38,220 --> 00:07:38,780
投票决定
We vote!

222
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:40,640
不行 你总威吓曼尼让他屈服
No way. You always bully Manny, and he caves.

223
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:41,200
他很懦弱
He's weak.

224
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:41,780
无意冒犯
No offense.

225
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,520
所有觉得我们应该雇用安迪的人
Whoever thinks that we should hire Andy,

226
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:44,760
举手
raise the hand!

227
00:07:46,180 --> 00:07:48,260
不行 对不起 妈妈 这回不行
No, sorry, mom. Not this time.

228
00:07:48,660 --> 00:07:50,300
我不想在家里承受这种压力
I can't have that energy in my house.

229
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,520
好吧 那你们自己做饭吃吧
Fine. Cook your own dinner!

230
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,340
行 我们没问题
We will. We'll be fine.

231
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:56,360
那我们今晚吃什么
So, what are we having?

232
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,420
孩子 你得靠你自己 我今晚要出去
You're on your own, kid. I'm going out tonight.

233
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,780
你们觉得怎么样
So, what do you think?

234
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:05,240
我喜欢这个
I like it.

235
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:08,460
不过 这个是不是有点儿像威利·旺卡
Also, is it a little Willy Wonka?

236
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:11,500
你们一定是累了 我等明天
You're tired. I'll come back tomorrow

237
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:13,580
你们可以接受建设性意见的时候再来
when you're ready to be more constructive.

238
00:08:13,580 --> 00:08:14,480
-胡娇 别走 -胡娇
- Pepper, no. - Pepper.

239
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,300
罗纳多 我们撤
Ronaldo, strike this.

240
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:20,120
抱歉 我还以为我今天穿着斗篷来的
Sorry. I thought I was wearing a cape today.

241
00:08:20,931 --> 00:08:22,318
我的上帝
Oh. Oh, my gosh.

242
00:08:22,318 --> 00:08:23,940
我们怎么办呐
Ohh. What are we gonna do?

243
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:26,020
我觉得我们得炒了胡娇
I-I think we have to fire Pepper.

244
00:08:26,020 --> 00:08:27,080
他会伤心至死的
That would kill him.

245
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:29,820
-他已经在崩溃的边缘了 -怎么了
- He's on the brink as it is. - Why?

246
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:32,740
自从加州8号提案被推翻后
Since the proposition ocho was overturned,

247
00:08:32,740 --> 00:08:34,460
他已经办了50场同性婚礼
he's done 50 gay weddings.

248
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:37,100
这男人为了新创意搜肠刮肚 耗尽心力
The man is exhausted, searching for new ideas.

249
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:38,120
你刚说了西语的"8"
You said "Ocho"

250
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,060
然后又说了英语的"50"
and then you said "50."

251
00:08:39,081 --> 00:08:42,545
看到没 基佬们总是这么挑剔
You see? Gays are so nit-picky.

252
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:43,920
办异性婚礼
In a straight wedding,

253
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,340
你只要尽力讨好新娘就行了
you just have to please the bride,

254
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:47,720
但基佬们个个极具个性
But the gays have such strong opinions!

255
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,780
这让胡娇·萨尔茨曼这种伟大的
It takes a toll on a great artist

256
00:08:49,789 --> 00:08:50,880
艺术家感到很受伤
like Pepper Saltzman.

257
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,140
我还从来没有从这个角度思考过
You know, I've never thought of it that way.

258
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,900
看看我们 我们自己都无法达成一致
I mean, look at us. We can't agree on one thing.

259
00:08:55,340 --> 00:08:56,220
没错 你说得对
No, you're right.

260
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,820
小卡想要一种乡村风格的主题
I mean, Cam wants a rustic country theme,

261
00:08:58,820 --> 00:08:59,800
而我则寻求一种
and I'm looking for something

262
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,720
略带现代感并精致的东西
a little more contemporary and sophisticated.

263
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,075
这根本就没法统一
And it's impossible.

264
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,640
但两种风格可以兼而有之
But you can have both.

265
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,880
写意的典雅 在经典的基础上略作改变
Casual elegance, classic with a twist.

266
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:07,840
继续说
Go on.

267
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:11,560
我会先用未经加工的天然亚麻长条桌布
I'd start with raw, natural-linen table runners

268
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:13,080
将两个世界连接在一起
to bring the two worlds together.

269
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,720
我们用带有农场特色的长方形桌面
We eschew the classic round tables

270
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,880
来避开经典圆形桌面的俗套
for rectangular farm tables,

271
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:20,340
但桌上的摆设要具有简洁的现代感
but keep the setting clean and modern.

272
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:21,980
然后
And then...

273
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:22,320
说啊
Yes!

274
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:25,500
不行 我不能这样 这样做不对
No, I mustn't. This is wrong.

275
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,820
胡娇是我的老板 我的良师
Pepper is my boss and my mentor!

276
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:30,120
他还是我们的朋友 我们在干什么
Oh, and he's our friend. What are we doing?

277
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:32,280
我们被迷惑了 我们没能抵抗住诱惑
We -- we got caught up. We gave in to temptation.

278
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,538
我得走了
I-I should go.

279
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:34,980
-别走 -我必须走
- Don't! - I must.

280
00:09:37,020 --> 00:09:39,320
用复古的手绢给泪流成海的宾客拭泪
Vintage handkerchiefs for the guests to cry into.

281
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,660
罗纳多 等等
Ronaldo, wait!

282
00:09:41,900 --> 00:09:44,020
用法式小酒馆那种带柄的红酒杯
French bistro stemless wine glasses.

283
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:46,160
我已经说了太多了
I've said too much.

284
00:09:46,700 --> 00:09:46,800
罗纳多
Ronaldo!

285
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,380
他走了 小卡
He's gone, Cam.

286
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:55,900
伙计们 我们不能整晚都这么站着
Guys, we can't stand around all night.

287
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:58,400
我们总得找个人搭讪
At some point, we have to talk to somebody.

288
00:09:59,300 --> 00:10:00,520
快点 那边那两位怎么样
Now, come on. How about those two?

289
00:10:01,580 --> 00:10:02,560
我们过去吧
Let's go over there.

290
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:04,540
天呐 我不知道自己为什么这么紧张
Oh, my god. I don't know why I'm so nervous.

291
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,040
-你们好 女士们 -没兴趣
- Hello, ladies. - Not interested.

292
00:10:10,110 --> 00:10:12,150
我不过打声招呼而已
Wow. I-I just said hello.

293
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:14,280
我们这是闺蜜间的小聚
We're just kind of having a girls' night.

294
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,360
凯西 友善些 我是玛希
Kathy, be nice. I'm marcy.

295
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:19,440
我是杰 这是弗兰克和菲尔
I'm Jay. This is Frank and, uh, Phil.

296
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,309
嗨好 我是想说你好 或者嗨
Hey-lo. I mean hey. Or hello.

297
00:10:21,620 --> 00:10:22,500
我也不知道
I don't know.

298
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,160
声明一下 我只想给你们介绍我的朋友
And for the record, i just wanted to introduce my friend.

299
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:26,580
我可没想跟你搭讪或是怎样
I wasn't trying to pick you up or anything.

300
00:10:27,220 --> 00:10:28,180
可真让我伤心
I'm heartbroken.

301
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:29,820
我们并不想打扰你们
We don't mean to disturb you.

302
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,420
你们没有打扰到我们
Oh, you're not disturbing us.

303
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:32,700
你的眼睛真漂亮
You have sweet eyes.

304
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,540
谢谢 我来自弗罗里达
Thank you. I'm from Florida.

305
00:10:34,740 --> 00:10:36,120
我超爱弗罗里达的
I love Florida!

306
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,840
要不要坐下一起聊 弗兰克
Would you like to sit down, Frank?

307
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:40,051
这个嘛 好吧
Well, I, uh -- yeah, sure.

308
00:10:40,051 --> 00:10:41,120
天啊 他真的要勾搭上女人了
Oh, my god. It's happening.

309
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:43,640
我告诉你 我老婆可是个大美女
For your information, I'm married to a gorgeous woman.

310
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,340
爸 杰和我
Dad, Jay and I

311
