-去吧台买杯喝的 -没问题
- are gonna grab a drink from the bar. - Sure.

312
00:10:47,060 --> 00:10:48,960
我手机里应该有她的照片
I think I have a picture of her here on this somewhere.

313
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:49,491
杰 我们走吧
Let’s go, Jay.

314
00:10:49,491 --> 00:10:50,960
她还赢过选美大赛呢
Yeah, she won beauty pageants.

315
00:10:51,194 --> 00:10:52,582
我可是很抢手的
Okay. I'm a catch.

316
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:55,020
我们赶紧走吧 这地方已经没意思了
Let's get out of here. This place is dead, anyway.

317
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,080
风流小子回家啦
Hey, there's Casanova!

318
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,440
我昨晚都没听见你回来
I didn't hear you come in last night.

319
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:06,360
你后来和玛希怎么样
So -- so, uh, how did it go with Marcy?

320
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,380
还行吧
Oh, it was okay.

321
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:09,880
但后来我打车的时候
But I actually met someone else

322
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:11,120
