while I was waiting for a taxi.

323
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,200
是吗
Well, all right.

324
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,060
她现在就在楼下呢
And she's downstairs right now.

325
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,280
那好啊
Well, all right.

326
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:20,840
实际上 我碰上点小麻烦
Truth is, I, um, have a bit of a situation.

327
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:23,060
她说我欠她五百美金
She says I owe her $500.

328
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,540
拜托你告诉我这是因为你弄伤了她
Please tell me you broke something of hers.

329
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:27,580
不是 原来她是个妓女
No, turns out she's a hooker.

330
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:28,440
你找了个妓女
You picked up a hooker?

331
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:30,040
我当时不知道她是妓女
Well, I didn't know she was a hooker.

332
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,980
别在我家厨房里再提"妓女"这个词了
We're in my kitchen. We have to stop saying "Hooker"!

333
00:11:32,837 --> 00:11:33,760
你得在克莱尔练瑜伽回来前
You got to get her out of here

334
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:35,040
把那女的弄出去
before Claire gets back from yoga.

335
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:37,180
不给钱她就不走
She's not gonna leave until she gets the cash.

336
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:39,480
五百美金吗 你被坑了吧
$500? I think you got ripped off.

337
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:41,800
-喝口你的咖啡成吗 -好吧
- Hey, can I have a hit of that coffee? - Oh, that's fine.

338
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:44,500
相信我 我绝对没坑他
Trust me. He did not get ripped off.

339
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,940
没事 你留着吧
No, that's good. It's yours.

340
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:56,120
这只有247块 我还得去取钱
$247. I'm gonna have to run to an atm.

341
00:11:56,940 --> 00:11:58,280
你怎么会没看出来呢
How could you not know?!

342
00:11:58,742 --> 00:12:00,240
又喝酒呀又调戏呀
Well, the drinks, the flirting.

343
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,560
就有点晕晕乎乎的嘛
