344
00:12:02,147 --> 00:12:04,017
你有没有摸过48岁女人的
Have you ever touched the smooth,

345
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:06,740
光滑柔软的皮肤
taut skin of a 48-year-old woman?

346
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,160
我希望有一天能摸到
I hope to one day,

347
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,380
但要是克莱尔回来发现...
but that's not gonna happen if Claire gets home and --

348
00:12:10,380 --> 00:12:12,580
我回来啦
Hi! I'm back!

349
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:15,380
弗兰克 昨天晚上玩得爽吗
Frank, did you have fun last night?

350
