不 一点儿都不爽
No. He did not.

351
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:17,460
厨房里那女的是谁啊
Hey. Who's the woman in the kitchen?

352
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:19,760
我哪儿知道 我去洗脸刷牙了
Beats me. I think I'll go freshen up.

353
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:21,260
厨房里有个女的吗
There's a woman in the kitchen?

354
